{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29162","headline":"送处士武君归章洪山居 · 许浑","name":"送处士武君归章洪山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"形影无羣消息沈，登闻三击血沾襟。\n皇纲一日开冤气，青史千年重壮心。\n却望乌台春树老，独归蜗舍暮云深。\n他时纵有徵书至，雪满空山不可寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}